    "_doc": {
        "purpose": "First experience AFTERMATH kojo, printed right after the red loss line (+ its relationship changes). One entry per body part sensitivityClassString (OnFirstExperience_[M|V|A|C|W|B]), fired from EvaluationPackage.GetFirstExperienceKojo for both aware and unaware losses. The moment of loss itself is narrated by the command kojo (firstexp_[class] branches), not here.",
        "selfTags": "firstexp_consent / firstexp_nonconsent, firstexp_unaware (owner sleeping/unconscious/timestopped), firstexp_after_unaware (aware loss of a part that already had an unaware one), plus EP self tags (raped, sleeping, unconscious, timestop, gender...).",
        "targetTags": "EP target tags (COM tags), partner body part tags (penis, mouth, vagina...), partner personal relationship ID (relationship_couple / relationship_marriage).",
        "results": "modifyRelationship: owner -> target score change; reverse = target -> owner. Scale: lover/player consensual Goodwill+10 Trust+5 Desire+5 (partner Desire+3); consensual Goodwill+5 Desire+3 (partner Desire+3); nonconsent hostile Badwill+15 Fear+10 Trust-15. Unaware: none. Womb (W): none, it is lost in the same act as V.",
        "format": "one voice line + one reaction line; unaware variants one narration line only.",
        "requirement": "every variant (nested ones included) sets requireEPSuccess false (forced acts carry requestAccepted false) and requireTargetAction false (partner may be unconscious); unaware variants also requireSelfAction false."
    },
